{
    "title": "TextNow: Call + Text Unlimited",
    "description": "Call and text for free with TextNow, the free phone service with over 100 million users, now including Free Essential Data. \r\n\r\nStaying connected shouldn\u2019t stress you out. With the TextNow app, you can get nationwide talk, text and data coverage from the nation\u2019s largest 4G LTE & 5G network, without having to worry about bills. \r\n\r\nGet a new phone number free with the US area code of your choice (or use the phone number you already have) and start calling and texting freely to anywhere in the US and Canada. \r\n\r\nFREE TALK & TEXT NATIONWIDE: NO PHONE BILL \r\nStay connected with the TextNow free Wi-Fi calling and texting app, or order a TextNow SIM card to freely talk, text, and use some apps without having to connect to Wi-Fi. \r\n\r\n\r\nFREE ESSENTIAL DATA \r\nTextNow is the ONLY phone service provider that gives you data completely FREE. With the always-free plan, you can access apps that are essential to keep you connected while on-the-go, including email, maps, and rideshare apps. Check and send emails, get directions, and order an Uber or Lyft from anywhere without paying for a data plan. Simply order a SIM card to get started and use your second phone number for any additional needs. \r\n\r\n  \r\nUNLIMITED DATA PLANS: AFFORDABLE & HIGH-SPEED \r\nWe believe you should only pay for the data you use. That\u2019s why we\u2019re the ONLY provider with super flexible hourly, daily, and monthly plans. Start and stop one of our low-cost options with just a few taps in the app, starting as low as $0.99. \r\n\r\n \r\nSECOND PHONE NUMBER: FOR PRIVATE CALLING & TEXTING, A SEPARATE BUSINESS LINE & MORE \r\nUse the TextNow calling and text messaging app as a free second phone line. It\u2019s another extra phone line (business phone or second line) on your device with free calls and free text messages. You can talk freely without any additional charges with your local/second phone number. \r\n\r\n   \r\nWHY TEXTNOW? \r\n\u2022 Free calling, free texting, and free essential data \u2013 always. \r\n\u2022 Call and text for free immediately when you download the TextNow app. \r\n\u2022 Choose TextNow as your default dialer for a seamless calling experience. By granting access to your call logs, you'll be able to easily find and call your contacts in the TextNow app, view your call history, manage missed calls, and sync your TextNow message history across all your devices. \r\n\u2022 Get nationwide coverage with a TextNow SIM card, and talk and text without Wi-Fi. \r\n\u2022 Get a local phone number or use your existing number. Area codes from most metro areas in the US available. \r\n\u2022 Voice call, direct message, picture and video messenger to the US or Canada for free. \r\n\u2022 Unlimited data plans with hourly, daily, and monthly options give you flexible internet coverage. Only pay when you want it. \r\n\u2022 Use across multiple devices including your computer or tablet, and effortlessly access calls and texts whenever you need them with Wi-Fi. \r\n\u2022 International calls with low-cost options to over 230 countries. \r\n\u2022 Voicemail to text audio transcription and conference calling via Wi-Fi. \r\n\r\n  \r\nHOW IS TEXTNOW FREE? \r\nThere are no yearly or monthly fees to use TextNow. We partner with brands to pay for your phone service (so you don\u2019t have to) with in-app ads. Ads won\u2019t interrupt your experience. If you don't like ads, you can purchase a subscription to remove them. \r\n\r\nMORE FEATURES \r\n\u2022 Passcode for private texting and calling \r\n\u2022 Caller ID \r\n\u2022 Customizable free text tones, call tones, ringtones, vibrations and phone backgrounds \r\n\u2022 Quick Reply to speedily respond to friends \r\n\u2022 A home screen widget for instant use \r\n\u2022 Text from your computer and seamlessly synchronize with your mobile device via textnow.com \r\n  \r\nNote: TextNow is not affiliated with other texting and calling apps like Talkatone, Text Me, TextPlus, TextFree, Pinger, Nextplus, TalkU, Dingtone, Whatsapp, Facebook Messenger and more. \r\n\r\nPrivacy policy: https://www.textnow.com/privacy \r\n\r\nTerms of use: https://www.textnow.com/terms",
