g apps like Talkatone, Text Me, TextPlus, TextFree, Pinger, Nextplus, TalkU, Dingtone, Whatsapp, Facebook Messenger and more. <br><br>Privacy policy: https://www.textnow.com/privacy <br><br>Terms of use: https://www.textnow.com/terms",
